  unitName: Ominous Slasher Aaron
  unitId: 60704
  unitNumber: 923
  description: The younger brother of quite a powerful demon. Whilst fighting against
    his powerful older brother, half of his power was sealed away. The reason behind
    their battle remains unknown, but the havoc that the siblings' fight brought
    about engulfed a multitude of demons, causing great destruction in Ishgria. Seeing
    no end to the fighting, the two brothers agreed to reconcile. However, the eldest
    had plotted against his little brother, sealing Aaron's powers into countless
    crystal shards that he scattered around Ishgria.
  summonDesc: Do you have any siblings? It doesn't matter. I will lend you my power,
    outsider.
  fusionDesc: Give me more power. I must become stronger than my brother so I can
    leave a legacy behind me!
